                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-align:center">
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:40px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">“庆祝建党百年 励志青春毅行。”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">2021</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">年</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">月</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">15</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">日，绍兴一中高一学生在老师与绍兴铁血户外拓展基地教官的带领下，赴平水上青古道，举行为期半天的毅行实践活动。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(80, 175, 175);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 15px"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240936550209.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240936550209.png" /></span></p><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: normal;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">破冰团建</span><span style="font-family:宋体"> 热血出征</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-bottom: 16px; text-indent: 2em;"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span><span style="font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 40px;">清晨微雨，十六个班驱车到达锁泗桥，迅速集结，井然有序。设计队名、喊出口号，五分钟后，各班纷纷在教官、老师们面前</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 1px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: 40px;">“一展神威”。当年红军长征两万五千里，而今我辈上青古道行。同学们拉伸完毕，满怀热血，踏上征程。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(80, 175, 175);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 15px"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240938096096.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240938096096.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240938094441.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240938094441.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(80, 175, 175);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 15px"></span>
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 "><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">披荆斩棘</span><span style="font-family:宋体"> 古道毅行</span></span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 37px;padding: 0;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">崎岖的石子路、湍急的山涧、耸立的砖墙、拦路的枝干</span><span style="font-family:宋体">……上青古道给初来乍到的同学们设下了重重关卡。大家一脚深一脚浅地踉跄而上，你搀我扶，唱响一首首红歌，谁也不肯被谁盖过。</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent: 37px;padding: 0;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">初霁的山林给青石板上了一层锃亮的釉，也使得原本陡峭的山坡更加难以攀爬。在老师和教官的一再提醒下，同学们尽量慢行，一步步征服。个别掉队的同学也丝毫没有退缩的念头，一个接一个地在老师的支持和同学的鼓励中前行，迎来了阵阵掌声与喝彩。不到一个小时，没有一个逃兵，全员行至山顶。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="color: rgb(80, 175, 175); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240938376201.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240938376201.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240938393802.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240938393802.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240938390756.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240938390756.JPG" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="color: rgb(80, 175, 175); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px;"></span>
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 "><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 16px;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family:宋体">苦中作乐</span><span style="font-family:宋体"> 朝气蓬勃</span></span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 40px;padding: 0;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">短暂而简单的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“午餐”过后，在盘山公路稍作休整的同学们按捺不住喜悦与激动，纷纷进行了拉歌活动：手机、音响、水瓶从各处被借来，烘托着“歌神”们动听的嗓音；相机、零食、照片四处传用，点燃了观众们积聚的热情；也有同学抛开设备一展歌喉，为静谧的山林带来了质朴浑厚的演出……</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent: 40px;padding: 0;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">意犹未尽之时，毅行继续。骄阳破开云雾，公路上显得有些灼热。山回路转，移步换景，惊叹于柳暗花明，天空地阔；草木葳蕤多姿，幽鸟时鸣，感佩于自然的无声伟力。旗帜鲜艳，两路纵队，在蜿蜒的山路上绵延，歌声起伏，山间回响；队伍浩荡，迤逦而下。午后时分，流连难返的同学们已抵达山脚终点。</span></p><p style=";text-indent: 40px;padding: 0;background: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">从阴雨绵绵到云销雨霁，从古道毅行到山路赏景，在建党百年的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">2021</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">初夏时节，绍兴一中高一学子，朝气蓬勃，征服了险长却又咫尺的上青古道。更动人的故事，更独特的感受与思考，且听同学细说</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 16px">——</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(80, 175, 175);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 15px"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240939114085.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240939114085.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240939124734.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240939124734.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/5/202105240939125543.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202105240939125543.png" /></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(80, 175, 175);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 15px"> </span><span style="color: rgb(80, 175, 175); font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px;"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:center;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(80, 175, 175);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 15px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 40px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:19px"> </span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">附</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">高一学子毅行感受选摘</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 40px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">上青古道记</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高一（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）班 邓冯玮</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">辛丑之年，时当孟夏。传一中峥嵘之岁月，继师生奋发之精神，致毅行也。弃捐书卷，拾掇囊裹，发乎鉴湖，至于日铸。乃自锁泗山行千二百步，绿树修竹，垒石潺水，古道行人，如在画中。足之所蹬，手之所抚，岩也藤也，目之所及，耳之所聆，雾也瀑也。此自然之山也，即心灵之道也，亦更新之路也。且行且待，歌啸相答。虽挥汗如雨，亦乐在其中。</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">及盘山而下，固得行而后知之理，不行不知上山易而下山难，不行不知坚持易而断续难，不行不知独往易而组织难，此皆伏案不就之理，不足为外人道也。</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-align:center"><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">毅行</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">有感</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高一（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）班</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px">  </span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">丁熠冬</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">天刚下过雨，空气里</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">氤氲着</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">青草伴着泥土的气息</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">我们来到了日铸岭古道，开始了毅行活动</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">在九十多年前的那个冬天，寒风凛冽，红军从瑞金出发，以双脚丈量了那两万五千里的征途。而今天，我们也要以自己顽强的体魄与不屈的意志，征服这积淀着千年历史的古道。</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">拾级而上，可见清流触石，洄悬激注，复行数十步，路左一溪悬捣，可谓是云根流玉液</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">,</span><span style="font-family:宋体">发泄出巅岩。及至公路，向西南极目远眺，树木丛生，百草丰茂，鸟鸣阵阵，墟落点点，为生机之交融。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">虽有如此胜景相伴，但还是无法消去那一抹疲劳，可所有人</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">依然昂首阔步</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">，因为每个人心中都有着一个坚定的信念，誓要到达终点，这信念宛若长征精神一般，给人力量，更让人铭肌镂骨。</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">远足小记</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">高一（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px">2</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">邱子怡</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px">    </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">时值夏初，太阳称不上热辣，但足以把我们晒得汗流浃背。一座看似清凉的大山里，一条长长的古道蜿蜒向上；一条长长的古道上，有一支稳健前行着的队伍；而那支队伍里，便有一个默默擦汗的我。我拉着同伴的手一个劲儿往上冲，只觉得一阵阵热浪袭来，衣服黏黏地纠结在一起，前路茫茫。忽而身边的竹林沙沙作响，清风临怀，身上的疲惫仿佛一扫而空，我们仰了仰脸，唱着歌又往上爬了。我这才明白先前所说重走长征路精神，不只是艰苦奋斗，更是苦中作乐。</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">
</span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px">    </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">我愿把炽热的阳光当作初夏的见面礼，把发烫的石头当作大山热情的心，把一场艰苦的远足当作一次充满歌与欢笑的旅行。少一些疲惫与抱怨，多一些乐观和坚持，便能看见山间的风水竹鸟，发现生活明朗，万物可爱。</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">暮春远足日铸岭</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">高一（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px">2</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">）</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px"> <span style="font-family:宋体">卢平洋</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（一）出发</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">充满迷雾的魔术布被揭开</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">一幅画在晴空下铺展：</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">穿越深林的凉风从中吹出</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">寄来自然蓬勃的呼唤</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">我们变成出笼的白鸽</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">欢腾，直指画中远山之巅</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（二）整队</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">汗珠凝结成滔天海浪</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">逼不停沿溪羽箭般疾行的落叶船</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">我们是团结挥刀斩断逆风的水手</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">正拉起比热带更热情的帆</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">石子连出的伟大航路上</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">弥漫着听懂林海真谛时惊奇的呐喊</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（三）上山</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">阳光投枪扎不透翠竹的盾</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">光影与那山路开了个剧院</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">青苔在古树上作画</span><span style="font-family:宋体">汗水在背上练字</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">背包夹着湿衣陶醉在扶持节拍间</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">清泉俯身向下冲</span><span style="font-family:宋体">少年昂首向上走</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">因为期待终点</span><span style="font-family:宋体">所以毅行上山</span></span></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（四）下山</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">遥远沙漠仿佛传来驼铃声</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">路边岩壁无草</span><span style="font-family:宋体">鸣虫踪影不见</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">伸出食指轻划天幕，拨来</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">镶着飞鸟的白云遮住骄阳与一片蓝</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">少男少女歌唱向自己向毅力向胜利</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">青春的音符在山路上浮现</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">（五）归来</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">貌似喝了一杯热茶</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">我们闭上了双眼</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">在清风的冲沏下</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">苦后又溢上了香甜</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">休息</span><span style="font-family:宋体">放松</span><span style="font-family:宋体">蓄力</span></span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">疲惫是最真实的梦幻</span></p><p style="margin-left:154px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px"> </span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:16px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">征服</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">高一</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>3<span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">班</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px">   </span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">张逸磊</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">十公里的山间路程，对于我们这些从小娇生惯养，没有吃过什么苦的</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">00</span><span style="font-family:宋体">后来说，无疑是一项巨大的挑战。一路跋涉，同学们从引吭高歌到渐渐沉默，从精力充沛到精疲力尽，从欣赏山间美景到祈望结束，最后所有注意力都只在脚下那一条曲折坎坷的青石板路。迈腿、前行…偶尔回头望去，看着脚下已征服的路程，不免自豪之感油然而生 ，猛然增加诸多勇气！</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family: 宋体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。人生之路犹如这段远足之旅，有平坦也有坎坷；有美景也有荆棘，但是当你勇于面对，披荆斩棘，迈过坎坷，就能欣赏美景，获得成功。就好像没有翻不过去的山，也就没有克服不了的困难。人生的价值正在于不断的突破与尝试之中。只有跨过了生命的坎坷的人才能寻找到自己的目标。将来的你，会感谢现在奋斗的自己！加油！</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">古道</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“长征”记</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">高一</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span>3<span style="font-family:宋体">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">班</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px">   </span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">宋加</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent: 14px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在一声声嘹亮的口号中，在同学们自发的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“万人大合唱”中，我们浩浩荡荡地开启了上清古道的远足之旅，这是一次属于我们的“长征之旅”。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">眼前是风景，我们心中亦是风景。踏入山林深处，踩着石子躲避着汩汩而来的水流。抬头仰望鸟儿划过天空后留下的安宁吧！镜头拉远，浩浩荡荡的人群穿梭在自然的怀抱中，回到最初的美好。这便是自然给我们的风景，又不妨称作我们缔造的风景。隔空向山的另侧的</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“战友”喊话，此景不免触景生情，想起电影中长征的团结画面，简单、纯真溢出长颈镜头。一句真心的鼓励，一次保卫友谊的伸手相助，最美好的风景，一直在同学们的心灵深处积淀。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;text-indent:28px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;vertical-align:baseline"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">此之谓古道</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“长征”，它留下的是友谊、团结、安宁的种子。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:239px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">上青古道记</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">高一（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px">4</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">）班</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">   <span style="font-family:宋体">朱一翀</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">四三九年，时值初夏，朱子与友幸游于上青古道。瑞雨潇潇，嘉木清圆，翠色接天，野花御胭，清风抚鬓，草雾回甘。路皆以小石成，青苔其上，黄叶其间。或因方雨，细水路间，若行溪中。余与友相谈甚欢，情至，而行歌晏晏。行而入山，则竹、木参天，荫而有习习之风，夹携芬芳，清凉之意，浑不觉暑气。行之渐远，则溪、道并行，苍木攀藤，翠竹垂拱。少顷，至桥，从此石阶千数，皆以大石成，坑洼含水，斑驳而碧藓滋于其间。道虽高险，复行不辍。</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">既至，则餐之。复下行，出茂林，见丛山，腰黄而冠碧，绵绵兮若泼墨成，行几百步，而见池嵌半山若翠玉也。余喜其美兮，曰：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“好耶。”或曰：“山薮弥瘴，川泽纳污，浓云蔽日，地火蒸木，负辎重而行彳亍，畏秽毒而步踟蹰，神恍惚而汗涔涔，众攘扰而无之处。此惟静心而恐不能，每自诵《清静经》而愈觉煎熬，何乐之有？”</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">曰：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“青山绿水，芳草嘉木，俯古道苍苍，仰天若冰玉，无烈日之焚躯，无桀晖之灼目，满旗灵风，润叶梦雨。踽而独步，则莹溪沨沨，玉蝉嘘嘘，鼻凝夏芳，眼映绿树；结而同行，则如伴玉山，似友玉树，恣意放荡，山水之徒。释怀于天地，寄情于友人，而忘身之所负。至于清静，自于风花雪月中得之。”</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">嗟夫，身置同境，而悲欢相异，何也？慧能云：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“非风动、帆动，是心动也。”清静得之，则身在无间，心在桃园也。清静未得，则浴华清而怨其奢，居蓬莱而哀其清，饮琼浆而怒其缛。非境有上下，心有上下也！今之众人，心之未静，志之未明，身处盛世尚不思自济，而囿于自哀，怨于天地，恢恢大道之不见，而困顿于锱铢之间，老子曰：“常沉若海，永失真道。”</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">静心而暑寒悲欢澄其心，戒燥而欲邪怨怒明其志，自可于浊世独善其身，盛世兼济天下。众曰：</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“好耶！”</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:48px">
</p><p style="margin-left:384px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px">2021/5/15</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">作于家中</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">路在脚下</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">高一（</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14px">4</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">）班</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">  <span style="font-family:宋体">潘涵</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">远足的一个星期前，这振奋人心的消息已传遍了整个学校。大家虽然有说太热的，有说没趣的，甚至还有直截了当地说不去的，但真的到了时辰，都还是拎着大包小包有说有笑的，没有人敢晚起床一分钟。</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">众所周知，四班只有别的班一半的人数，但是论整活能力，却可以和半个年段平分秋色。在车上就已经唱起经久不衰的班歌。到了集合点直接给班级取了个</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“苏联”的班名——谐音“四</span></span><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">连</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px">”。作为班长的我，也有点哭笑不得。</span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">而当真正踏上上青古道，期待的美好确实货真价实。上山时走林间石板路，一路清泉绿叶相伴。歌声、脚步声、水声、鸟叫声和着雨后的土壤气息，让我们感受到校园之外蓬勃的气息。下山时走盘山公路，骄阳似火，我们</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“咏而归”。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">此次远足，除去在</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“读万卷书，行万里路”中实地复习了亚热带常绿阔叶林的景观、公路转弯时的倾斜角等学到过的学科知识，大家还在此次活动中收获了一段互助的友谊，一份分享的乐趣，一种自始至终的坚持。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">信奥之路曲折坎坷，有成功的欢愉也有失败的忧伤，有矛盾挣扎，有失落迷惘。敢问路在何方？路在脚下。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:28px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent: 40px"><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:19px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
